  },
  {
    "sourceId": 20,
    "key": "wotc-chats",
    "quote": "Why are there holo and non-holos in jungle and fossil? After hearing many people’s comments on not wanting to play with their holo cards from base set, we decided to make the rare’s in both forms.",
